  "text": "Happy to. Your week is packed, so a few choices matter before I book anything:\n\n- **You have no free hour** Mon–Fri between 09:00 and 17:00. The only 30-minute gaps are Mon 10:00–10:30, Mon 14:00–14:30, Tue 11:00–11:30, Tue 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30 and Wed 13:00–13:30.\n- So: how long should the staff meeting be, and would you rather squeeze it into one of those 30-minute gaps, or have me ask the TAs whether anyone can meet outside your booked blocks in a slot I then create?\n\nMy suggestion: a 30-minute meeting in **Wed 13:00–13:30** (right before the 13:30 guest lecture prep), or **Tue 11:00–11:30**. Tell me which, and I'll book it and put the request to the group thread.",
  "seq": 0,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-19T11:16:29Z"
 },
 {
